{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hindenburg - LZ129: TimeLab DLC</strong><br>The Virtual Time Travel Experience...<br>Embark on a journey aboard the legendary airship <i>Hindenburg</i> in the year 1936. Walk through the luxurious passenger decks, marvel at old New York as the <i>Hindenburg</i> floats above the skyscrapers, and witness its final voyage...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Immersive Simulation</strong> \u2013 Step into the world of the 1930s and experience the journey of the <i>Hindenburg</i> in breathtaking detail. Discover the technical innovations and daily life aboard the world's largest airship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Explore the <i>Hindenburg</i></strong> \u2013 Enter the luxurious passenger areas, the dining hall, and the lounge, or take a look at the technical sections like the control room and hydrogen tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Historical Insights</strong> \u2013 Learn fascinating details about the construction, operation, and tragic explosion of the airship, and immerse yourself in aviation history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Bonus Game: &quot;Skywave&quot;</strong> \u2013 Test your skills in a retro-style game where you navigate a stylized zeppelin through skyscrapers and enjoy neon-lit landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the grandeur and elegance of the <i>Hindenburg</i> and be captivated by one of the most impressive chapters in aviation history. A must for history and technology enthusiasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now available on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This DLC requires our VR platform <i>TimeLab</i>, also available on Steam.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1491210?t=1742828006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491210/7077c1